this mod also adds a item called a wand you can right click onto blocks this command is a command for your wond
and it adds a item called the selector that you can do cool things with ![selector](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d9b3e273d3b89fac04d3dd0c9ac5815d8598482a.gif)
